  "body": "Designed by Warren & Mahoney Architects, fitted with luxury Italian kitchens by Molteni&C, brought to you by Gosling.  \r\n\r\nWelcome to Pavilion, a boutique collection architecturally designed apartments on the cusp of Kohimarama Beach.\r\nThese exquisite apartments have been carefully considered to an exacting standard, uniquely designed by Warren & Mahoney Architects to make the most of the extraordinary location directly beside this popular inner-East beach in central Auckland.\r\n\r\nWith 2-3 bedrooms and 2-2.5 bathrooms, the homes feature beautifully curated spaces in high quality materials, an underground carpark, a stunning feature lift, selected high end appliances – and fitted with Molteni&C luxury Italian kitchen, scullery and wardrobes.\r\n\r\nAn iconic curved façade faces North, with a sunny aspect that looks out directly across the water toward Rangitoto and Motuihe Island. Grounded in landscaped gardens, the ground level apartments each enjoy an elevated private garden terrace, with a landscaped garden courtyard shared by all apartments.\r\n\r\nConsidered architectural detailing on the exterior features a custom architectural brick façade, draws inspiration from the form of coastal cliffs. Punctuated by extensive glazing, large wraparound terraces, a striking external staircase and lift shaft, and enclosed wintergardens with frameless glass that open up entirely to capture the sun and make the most of the exceptional ocean views and seaside air.\r\n\r\nThe interior design inspiration is rooted in the simplicity of coastal living and the rituals of a barefoot beachside lifestyle. Textural finishes and details reflect the coastal environment, with soft natural tones of cream, sand and wood throughout creating a harmonious sensory landscape.\r\n\r\nDirectly across the road from Kohimarama Beach and esplanade, and just a stroll down the block to Kohi Beach Eatery and Store, this is a place designed around local rituals and community.\r\n\r\nWith the buzz of Auckland’s urban heart and harbourside commercial districts easily accessible along Tamaki Drive, the pace of life is yours to define day to day. \r\n\r\nThese apartments are truly one of a kind, offering an exclusive opportunity to be part of the architectural renewal of the exclusive Kohimarama beachfront area.\r\n\r\nApartment 102 - $3,250,000\r\n\r\nTo explore visit www.beachhouse.nz/pavilion",
